you want to perform that operation.", "ExampleText"],
  Cell["Select the CalcHEP installation, model and QED sector explicitly for \
an independent unpolarized comparison. Replace the installation path, model \
directory and model number with your chosen reference.", "ExampleText"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"calcHEPDirectory", " ", "=", " ",
